					"nextDialogs": [
						40190302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萊歐斯利"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190302,
					"content": "來看看梅洛彼得堡的情況嘛！應該還好吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190303,
					"content": "問題不大，那維萊特過來擺平了一些棘手問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萊歐斯利"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190304,
					"content": "既然這樣，你們直接請他留在這裡不就好了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190305,
					"content": "噢，好辦法。我們可以一起說服最高審判官為了一片水拋棄整個法庭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萊歐斯利"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190306,
					"content": "行不通吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190307
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 40190307,
					"content": "他匆匆下來一趟，茶都沒喝一口就回去了。不過帶走了護士長給他的禮物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萊歐斯利"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190308,
					"content": "聽起來是個大忙人呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190309,
					"content": "克洛琳德小姐也回去了，同樣帶走了護士長的禮物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萊歐斯利"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190310,
					"content": "禮物是奶昔嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190311,
					"content": "給那維萊特的是奶昔，給克洛琳德的是唇膏。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萊歐斯利"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190312,
					"content": "欸？差好多啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190313,
					"content": "誰叫克洛琳德沒有那維萊特那麼忙，而且足夠健康呢。護士長又喜歡為女士挑選美容用的禮物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萊歐斯利"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190314,
					"content": "#對了，也有給{F#妳}{M#你}們的禮物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萊歐斯利"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190315,
					"content": "護士長送的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190316,
					"content": "我送的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萊歐斯利"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190317,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們在梅洛彼得堡的事已經辦完，隨時可以返回水上，只是刑期還沒結束。期滿之前，原先那間牢房可供{F#妳}{M#你}們隨便使用。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萊歐斯利"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190318,
					"content": "真的可以嗎？那豈不是還能住好久！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190319,
					"content": "包伙食嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190320
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 40190320,
					"content": "#餐廳將對{F#妳}{M#你}們免費開放。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萊歐斯利"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190321,
					"content": "好耶！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190322,
					"content": "記得刑滿釋放那天來我這裡辦手續。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "萊歐斯利"
				}
			]
		},
