				{
					"id": 40190609,
					"content": "我才不是那樣呢！好啦…我是想說，其實，我們兩個還滿厲害的哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190610,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}看，我們一起經過了那麼多地方，認識了那麼多人。不斷地旅行…不斷地結識新的朋友。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190611,
					"content": "世界上有那麼多麻煩，我們只有兩個人，卻一直在解決麻煩…不是很厲害嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190612,
					"content": "我們是最好的冒險家哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 40190613,
					"content": "#我也算嗎？只有{F#妳}{M#你}是冒險家吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190614,
					"content": "嚮導也算。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190615
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 40190615,
					"content": "那下次請凱瑟琳小姐也發個冒險家之證給我好啦！冒險家派蒙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190616,
					"content": "#想想就開心…我要睡啦，{F#妳}{M#你}也早點睡吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190617,
					"content": "上次睡在這裡，一覺醒來外面都鬧翻天了…胎海水也漲上來，好嚇人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190618,
					"content": "今天總不會了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190619,
					"content": "不會的，放心睡吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190620
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 40190620,
					"content": "嗯，那先晚安啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40190621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40190621,
					"content": "晚安派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		},
